</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/36077645/Using+Concept+Groups+to+Display+Unknown+and+Abnormal+Indicators\" data-linked-resource-id=\"36077645\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Using Concept Groups to Display Unknown and Abnormal Indicators</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/33456359/Auto-Calculation+of+Observations\" data-linked-resource-id=\"33456359\" data-linked-resource-version=\"22\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Auto-Calculation of Observations</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/42729508/Adding+Scanned+Documents+to+Forms\" data-linked-resource-id=\"42729508\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Adding Scanned Documents to Forms</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014550/Configure+Observations+Tab\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014550\" data-linked-resource-version=\"81\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Observations Tab</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014556/Configure+Diagnosis+Tab\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014556\" data-linked-resource-version=\"30\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Diagnosis Tab</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014561/Configure+Disposition+Tab\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014561\" data-linked-resource-version=\"21\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Disposition Tab</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014566/Configure+Consultation+UI\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014566\" data-linked-resource-version=\"19\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Consultation UI</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014568/Configure+Orders+Tab+for+Lab+and+Radiology\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014568\" data-linked-resource-version=\"54\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Orders Tab for Lab and Radiology</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/2908618776/Configuring+other+order+types\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2908618776\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configuring other order types</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014570/Configure+Medication+Tab\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014570\" data-linked-resource-version=\"67\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Medication Tab</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/79495202/Configure+Orderset+rules\" data-linked-resource-id=\"79495202\" data-linked-resource-version=\"20\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Orderset rules</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3464527901/Configure+rules+based+medication+dosage\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3464527901\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure rules based medication dosage</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3546251350/Print+Medications\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3546251350\" data-linked-resource-version=\"4\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Print Medications</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/34013226/Configure+Bacteriology+Tab\" data-linked-resource-id=\"34013226\" data-linked-resource-version=\"39\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Bacteriology Tab</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37355579/Encounter+Session\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37355579\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Encounter Session</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3647176711/Provider+Acknowledgement+for+Emergency+Medication+Administered+by+Ward+Nurse\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3647176711\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Provider Acknowledgement for Emergency Medication Administered by Ward Nurse</a></li></ul><p> </p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
